  "historyNote": "#10494, eff 1-1-14; ss by #12347, eff 8-14-17; ss by #14280, eff 8-1-25; ss by #14375, INTERIM, eff 9-20-25; ss by #14525, eff 2-28-26, EXPIRES: 2-28-36",
